customer: skater_bro
problem: dust_overheat
brief:
	His computer runs Cambion: the calculator answers 666 to every sum (the Calc666 bug, secret). Nothing points the player there; they find it by chance.

== drop-off
(neutral) Yo! What's up! Is this the computer repair shop?
- Welcome to Compufun! You're in the right place! How can I help you?
	(happy) Sweet! Maybe you can help a buddy out!
	(neutral) My computer isn't working!
- What gave it away?
	(angry) Whatever dude.. You don't have to be a douche about it, I have some real issues here: My computer is all fugged...

- What seems to be the issue?
	(problem) Dude! Check it: When I try to start it, everything first seems to work primo.. But as soon as it opens Windows it just turns off and then turns on again!
	(angry) Now I can't access any of my dope MIDI songs!

+ Can you think of anything else that might help me diagnose the issue?
	(thinking) I guess it was a little hot when I unplugged it to bring it over.. I figured it was my cat Loka.
	(happy) She tends to sleep on the box while I'm at the computer.
- I'll take a look. Just leave it here and I'll call you when it's ready for pickup!
	(happy) Dope! I appreciate it! Catch you on the flipside!
	- Have a FUNtastic day!
	- ...later.
	(neutral) Later, skater! [leaving]

== pick-up
(neutral) Yo yo yo! You rang! Did you fix it?
- Hello, sir! Yes! It was overheating because of a dusty fan. I cleaned and replaced it!
- Yup - Here you go!
(happy) DOPE! Muchos gracias dude!
- You're welcome! Have a funtastic day!
- No biggie. Stay safe!
(neutral) Peace out! [leaving]
